id=hypercharging
name=HYPER CHARGING+ ⚡
version=2.0
versionCode=2
author=Razal (Razal1_1)
description=Adaptive fast-charging control with real-time awareness notification. 12 thermal tiers with independent current control, gradual step-down and fast charge re-negotiation on tier transitions, 48°C emergency cutoff with 46°C restore (~2°C hysteresis), game bypass with persistent enforcer, battery tapering at 85%/90%/95%/99% with 2-minute stop at 100%, live notification with estimated charge time, battery remaining, and full charge timestamp. Extended USB, QC, HVDCP and BMS node support. Final charging behavior governed by hardware, charger and thermal limits.
